{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49892","headline":"虞美人 · 无名氏","name":"虞美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帐中草草军情变，月下旌旗乱。\n褫衣推枕怆离情，远风吹下楚歌声，正三更。\n抚骓欲下重相顾，艳态花无主。\n手中莲锷凛秋霜，九泉归去是仙乡，恨茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}